      <h1>How to Buy Baijiu Outside China</h1>
      <p class="lede">Finding baijiu abroad is easy. Finding a bottle that is authentic, fairly priced, and actually the product you think it is — that is the hard part, and it is solvable with a short checklist.</p>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>Reading time <b>11 min</b></span>
